        "global": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "GET /client/global returns a static status page. /global sends one JSON status message after WebSocket upgrade and echoes Ping frames with Pong. No gameplay traffic uses WebSockets. Other legacy endpoints return explicit stubs."
        },
        "player": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Slots 0\u20134 are Red and slots 5\u20139 are Blue. Supply a raw BASIC file. The existing Polyworld BASIC host API runs with bounded source, memory, work, and instruction limits. PRINT is private. See the game guide and bundled base.bas for a complete working player."
        }
